{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S04\",\"screen\":\"手不自觉握得更紧，想用力抱牢当下，又怕太用力让小船颠簸失衡\",\"source\":\"自己也许还没有意识到在害怕什么，动作已经先透露了出来。另一幅更晃荡的画面，是想用力抱紧对方、牢牢抓住当下；但你越用力，水面的颠簸就越剧烈，船舱内的平衡就越脆弱。\",\"type\":5,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿没有明确说他害怕的是用力导致失衡，只把未明的害怕与船舱失衡的画面分别呈现；屏幕稿将两者接成了明确的害怕动机。\"},{\"sec\":\"S06\",\"screen\":\"他猜对方一直没有退开，会不会也有点舍不得结束这份亲近？\",\"source\":\"他又忍不住想，对方既然一直没有退开，会不会也有一点舍不得结束这份亲近？\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿把对方一直没有退开作为已知事实，只对对方是否舍不得结束亲近有所猜测；屏幕稿的“猜”也覆盖了对方没有退开这一事实。\"},{\"sec\":\"S14\",\"screen\":\"像经历强烈的内心震荡后站起来，整理好衣服，轻轻关上了门\",\"source\":\"也可以想成一个人经历了强烈的内心震荡后，站起来，整理衣服，关上门。\",\"type\":5,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"屏幕稿额外加入“轻轻”，给原本没有限定方式的关门动作添加了具体的动作质感。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "99632bef-6e53-4831-a196-17e5a0b89061", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T223359975732Z", "elapsed_seconds": 159.047, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T22:36:39.035788+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "57082faf7084bbd1ffc4992c302dc9f20419857ed34e814d22acf73084ff142f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 